dataprop TABLEAT(codepage, int, int) =
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1250(Cp1250(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1250(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1251(Cp1251(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1251(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1252(Cp1252(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1252(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1253(Cp1253(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1253(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1254(Cp1254(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1254(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1255(Cp1255(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1255(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1256(Cp1256(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1256(byte, point)
  | {byte,point:int} TABLEAT_Cp1257(Cp1257(), byte, point) of PAGEAT_Cp1257(byte, point)
